            "heading": "Will sold-out items come back?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Sometimes, but we don’t promise it. The first edition of the tarot is 100 decks in English and 100 in Slovak. If something you want is gone, leave your email on its page and we’ll write to you if it returns.</p>",
