          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Write to <a href=\"mailto:support@walterin.com\">support@walterin.com</a> as soon as you can. If the order hasn’t gone out yet, we’ll change it or cancel it. If it has, you can still withdraw from the purchase within 14 days.</p>",
