            "heading": "What can I pay with?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Visa, Mastercard, American Express, JCB, Discover and Diners Club, plus Apple Pay and Google Pay. Payments go through Stripe. We don’t offer cash on delivery.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
