          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I send something back?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. You have 14 days from the day the parcel arrives, and you don’t have to give a reason. Use the <a href=\"/pages/withdrawal\">withdrawal form</a> in the footer, or write to <a href=\"mailto:support@walterin.com\">support@walterin.com</a>.</p><p>Send the item back within 14 days of telling us. You pay the return postage. We refund everything you paid, including the cheapest standard delivery we offer, within 14 days.</p><p>eBooks work differently. Once the download starts, the right to withdraw is gone — you agree to that in the cart, before you pay.</p>",
